# Execution Gate

At the end of **every phase**, execution pauses for the required handoff summary.

The next phase begins only when:

```text
Build succeeds
+ Tests pass
+ New tech debt is resolved
+ No unresolved diagnostics remain
+ Phase summary is accepted
```

The implementation should not begin by adding padding to individual screens. The first implementation target should be the actual shared bottom-chrome owner confirmed during Phase 0.